{
  "purpose": "Prove that capture reports the DOM's own disclosure state - collapsed / expanded / neither - for the three ways a page declares it (a closed <details>, aria-expanded, an unselected role=tab), which is the evidence the crawler's pre-capture expansion pass decides from. Without it the only way to find a field behind a collapsed accordion is to click things and hope.",
  "targeted_defect": "BUG-DISCLOSURE-BLIND: capture emitted no signal that a <details> was shut (`open` is a property, not an attribute), so a deliberate expansion pass could not be written and every field inside a collapsed section went uncatalogued. Fixed by disclosureState() (M2.6 / T-CAP-03).",
  "lanes": [
    "jsdom",
    "playwright"
  ],
  "snippet": "INVENTORY_JS",
  "min_controls": 6,
  "expect_controls": [
    {
      "where": {
        "css_hint": "button#acc-beneficiary"
      },
      "fields": {
        "name": "Beneficiary details",
        "disclosure": "collapsed",
        "expanded": "false",
        "haspopup": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "css_hint": "button#acc-contact"
      },
      "fields": {
        "name": "Contact preferences",
        "disclosure": "expanded",
        "expanded": "true"
      }
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "css_hint": "summary"
      },
      "fields": {
        "name": "Medical history",
        "disclosure": "collapsed",
        "expanded": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "css_hint": "button#tab-term"
      },
      "fields": {
        "name": "Term life",
        "disclosure": "collapsed"
      }
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "css_hint": "button#tab-whole"
      },
      "fields": {
        "name": "Whole life",
        "disclosure": "expanded"
      }
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "css_hint": "button#submit-app"
      },
      "fields": {
        "name": "Submit application",
        "disclosure": "collapsed"
      }
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "css_hint": "button#nav-more"
      },
      "fields": {
        "name": "More",
        "disclosure": "collapsed",
        "haspopup": "menu"
      }
    },
    {
      "where": {
        "css_hint": "input#full-name"
      },
      "fields": {
        "name": "Full name",
        "disclosure": ""
      }
    },
    {
